<p>
The columns in the report are defined as follows:
</p>

<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Consented?</strong> - Do we have consent to access the site. Without this we cannot access the API
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Loading Enabled?</strong> - Is the SolarEdge site set to active? If not, then loading is disabled
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Metered Solar Configured?</strong> - Does the school have an active electricity meter with a metered
    solar attribute that refers to the production meter for this site? If not, then we are not using the data from this site
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Solar Meter Active?</strong> - Is the solar meter for the site set to active in our system?
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Export Meter Active?</strong> - Is the export meter for the site set to active in our system?
    If not, then we won't be loading data for that meter
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Electricity Meter Active?</strong> - Is the grid electricity meter for the site set to active in our
    system? If not, then we won't be loading data for that meter
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Daily Credit Estimate</strong> - Estimate of daily API credits used to load data for this site.
    Will be zero if the site is not consented or active. Otherwise costs are 2 credits + 2 * active meters per day
  </li>
</ul>
